ORIGIN
------

The schematic and PCB layout in this repository are original work. The
circuit is a textbook Widlar current split (a diode-connected transistor
with an emitter resistor stealing base drive from a parallel transistor)
applied to a plug-in transistor adaptor; it contains no third-party
material.
